        <mxCell id="f06concept-note" value="F06 / V10: reviewable candidates only. Types: BUNDLE | CROSS_SELL | FBT | BANNER. Review: PENDING_REVIEW → APPROVED or REJECTED; version &gt; 0; review history stores resulting_version and eligibility_check. Frozen policy_snapshot, evidence, generation_eligibility and explanation preserve decision context. Approval does not create executable BUNDLE, CAMPAIGN or LAYOUT records; those retained entities are future downstream concepts." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=8;">
